%% 备份 / 恢复 / 下载时序（源码：Console BackupController → BackupService）
sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as 控制台前端
    participant BC as BackupController
    participant BS as BackupService
    participant REPO as BackupRecordRepository
    participant AUD as AuditService
    participant EXE as backupExecutor
    participant GW as RespGateway
    participant KV as 内核实例
    participant FS as 本地文件

    rect rgb(238,242,255)
    Note over UI,FS: ① 创建备份（异步）
    UI->>BC: POST /api/v1/backups?instanceId
    BC->>BS: export(instanceId)
    BS->>REPO: findFirst(RUNNING)
    REPO-->>BS: 无 / 超时记录
    Note over BS: 按实例加锁（TD-101）<br/>检查与落库原子
    BS->>REPO: save(RUNNING)
    BS->>AUD: record(CREATE_BACKUP)
    BS->>EXE: submit(runExport)
    BS-->>UI: 200 RUNNING 记录
    EXE->>GW: execute(SCAN cursor MATCH * COUNT 200)
    GW->>KV: RESP 请求
    KV-->>GW: 键列表（游标 + keys）
    GW-->>EXE: RespReply
    EXE->>KV: TYPE / TTL / GET（逐键取值，同样经网关）
    EXE->>FS: 写 JSONL（一行一个 SnapshotEntry）
    EXE->>REPO: save(SUCCESS, keyCount, sizeBytes)
    end

    rect rgb(239,246,241)
    Note over UI,FS: ② 恢复（合并式 / 幂等 / 非原子，ADR-0365）
    UI->>BC: POST /backups/{id}/restore
    BC->>BS: restore(id)
    BS->>REPO: findById(id)
    BS->>FS: readAllLines
    loop 每一行 SnapshotEntry
        BS->>GW: execute(DEL key)
        GW->>KV: 删除同键
        BS->>GW: execute(SET / HSET / RPUSH / SADD / ZADD)
        GW->>KV: 写入备份值
        opt ttl > 0
            BS->>GW: execute(EXPIRE key ttl)
            GW->>KV: 恢复过期时间
        end
    end
    BS->>AUD: record(RESTORE_BACKUP, restored=N)
    BS-->>UI: 返回回放条数（== keyCount）
    end

    rect rgb(253,244,231)
    Note over UI,FS: ③ 下载
    UI->>BC: GET /backups/{id}/download
    BC->>BS: download(id)
    BS->>FS: 校验路径在备份目录内
    BS->>AUD: record(DOWNLOAD_BACKUP)
    BS-->>UI: 文件流（attachment）
    end